@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@userId = 1
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@bearerToken = paste-login-token-here
@token = idem_替换为你的幂等token
@debugSyncToken = idem_替换为调试同步下单token


### 1. 获取幂等 token
### 执行后复制 data.token 到 @token。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}


### 2. 使用 token 异步下单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}


### 3. 重复使用同一个 token，应该失败
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}


### 4. 获取新 token
### 执行后复制 data.token 到 @debugSyncToken。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}


### 5. [已废弃] 使用新 token 同步下单，仅用于本地调试；高并发主链路不要使用
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{debugSyncToken}}"
}


### 6. 不传 token，下单失败
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1
}


### 7. 传错误 token，下单失败
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "idem_wrong_token"
}


### 8. 传过期 token，下单失败
### token 默认 5 分钟过期。获取 token 后等待超过 5 分钟再执行本请求。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}


### Redis 验证
### redis-cli KEYS 'order:idempotency:user:*'
